53
00:05:03.779 --> 00:05:06.029
Sinililli.

54
00:05:18.140 --> 00:05:19.679
Oli siis.

55
00:05:19.779 --> 00:05:22.379
Lonkab ja möliseb, sõime

56
00:05:29.529 --> 00:05:34.890
